; -----------------------------------------------------------------------
; Main Menu, imported from "Octet - Main Menu.dc.html"
; (docs/DESIGN_HANDOFF.md). Colours below are literal DesignTokens values
; baked in -- .tscn files are parsed before autoloads exist, so they can't
; reference the DesignTokens singleton at load time (same documented
; exception as game/gameplay.tscn). Keep in sync by hand if the palette
; changes:
;   COLOR_INK             #0C0A0F -> Color(0.047, 0.039, 0.059, 1)
;   COLOR_SURFACE         #16131B -> Color(0.086275, 0.07451, 0.105882, 1)
;   COLOR_HAIRLINE        #2A2431 -> Color(0.164706, 0.141176, 0.192157, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_PRIMARY    #F5F1F5 -> Color(0.960784, 0.945098, 0.960784, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_SECONDARY  #A79FAE -> Color(0.654902, 0.623529, 0.682353, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_MUTED      #6E6676 -> Color(0.431373, 0.4, 0.462745, 1)
;   COLOR_PINK            #FF2D6E -> Color(1, 0.176471, 0.431373, 1)
;   COLOR_AMBER           #FFC93C -> Color(1, 0.788235, 0.235294, 1)
;
; Known deviation from the mockup (Godot has no rounded-circle gradient
; fill without a shader): the profile avatar is a flat COLOR_PINK circle
; rather than the mockup's 135deg pink-to-orchid diagonal gradient. Flagged
; per CLAUDE.md's design-fidelity rule rather than silently approximated.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------

